feat(evavo-local-image-generator): Establish proper module structure and digest-bound task manifest

Implement core architecture for local EVAVO multi-modal generation system:

Core Components:
- EvavoLocalImageGeneratorMCPServer: MCP protocol implementation with STDIO handler
- GenerationTask: SHA-256 digest-bound task execution framework
- ComfyUIClient: Async HTTP communication with ComfyUI backend (port 8188)
- BeeStorageClient: bee:// URI resolution for BeeStation network storage abstraction
- Storage manifest-based digest tracking for secure task validation

Package Structure:
- evavo_local_image_generator/__init__.py: Module metadata and public API exports
- evavo_local_image_generator/__main__.py: Entry point for CLI execution (python -m)
- evavo_local_image_generator/mcp_server.py: Full MCP protocol implementation (~680 lines)
- evavo_local_image_generator/scripts/generate.py: Image generation and batch processing (~320 lines)
- evavo_local_image_generator/scripts/storage.py: BeeStation URI resolution and digest validation (~280 lines)
- evavo_local_image_generator/tests/__init__.py: Test suite placeholder

Configuration & Documentation:
- .mcp.json: MCP server registration pointing to module entry point
- evavo-repository-task-manifest.json: Digest-bound task definitions (7 tasks: 3 implemented, 4 planned)
- README.md: Comprehensive architecture, API reference, integration guidelines
- CLAUDE.md: Operating notes and infrastructure integration patterns
- requirements.txt: Python dependencies (httpx async HTTP client)
- .gitignore: Scoped to Python runtime, virtual environments, platform artifacts

Key Architecture Principles:
- NEVER assume Windows paths visible to hosted Claude - use bee:// URI abstraction only
- SHA-256 digest-bound execution for secure task validation
- Immutable storage through evavo-storage (0.14.3+) integration
- evavo-local-storage (0.31.0) for logical URI discovery on BeeStation
- Integration with local ComfyUI (127.0.0.1:8188), Ollama (127.0.0.1:11434), Kokoro (127.0.0.1:8000)

Environment Configuration:
- EVAVO_LOCAL_IMAGE_GENERATOR_MODE: production/debug modes
- EVAVO_LOCAL_IMAGE_GENERATOR_STORAGE: bee://primary/EVAVO/ImageGeneration default storage path
- EVAVO_COMFYUI_ENDPOINT: ComfyUI backend endpoint (http://127.0.0.1:8188)
- PYTHONUNBUFFERED: 1 for real-time logging

